---
// About: story, credentials and off the clock. Home section (h2) or /about/ page (h1).
interface Props {
  level?: 1 | 2;
}

const { level = 2 } = Astro.props;
const Title = level === 1 ? 'h1' : 'h2';
const Sub = level === 1 ? 'h2' : 'h3';
---

<section class="profile" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="profile__inner">
    <figure class="profile__photo">
      <picture>
        <source type="image/avif" srcset="/field-coach-480.avif 480w, /field-coach-720.avif 720w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, (max-width: 1080px) 38vw, min(30vw, 470px)" />
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="/field-coach-480.webp 480w, /field-coach-720.webp 720w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, (max-width: 1080px) 38vw, min(30vw, 470px)" />
        <img src="/field-coach-720.webp" width="720" height="720" alt="Ac coaching at a CrossFit event" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </picture>
    </figure>

    <div class="profile__body">
      <Title id="about-title">About</Title>
      <p class="profile__open">I studied Information Technology at the University of San Carlos, then went all in on CrossFit.</p>
      <p>I own CrossFit Subtero, two gyms in Cebu City, and I'm Country Manager for CrossFit Philippines. I also own Flame &amp; Finish, which imports building materials, and <a href="https://andar.ph">Andar</a>, a software automation and AI solutions company.</p>
      <p>I've coached CrossFit for more than ten years, hold the Level 3 credential and race HYROX.</p>
      <p class="profile__coach">I also coach athletes remotely. I write your program, check your training and adjust it as you go. <a href="/coaching/">Read about remote coaching</a></p>
    </div>

    <aside class="profile__side" aria-label="Credentials and off the clock">
      <div class="sidebox">
        <Sub class="sidebox__title">Credentials</Sub>
        <ul>
          <li>CrossFit Level 3 Trainer</li>
          <li>OPEX CCP1</li>
          <li>Precision Nutrition Level 1</li>
          <li>HYROX athlete</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="sidebox sidebox--plain">
        <Sub class="sidebox__title">Off the clock</Sub>
        <p>Husband and father. They are the whole point. Then Dungeons &amp; Dragons, World of Warcraft, and whatever problem refuses to leave my head.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
